https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc13.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"TryScent customer — clean formula without phthalates and parabens\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>No Phthalates. No Parabens. No Endocrine-Disrupting Chemicals.</h3>\n          <p>Phthalates are added to most mainstream perfumes to make the scent last longer. <strong>Studies have found them in human tissue.</strong> They're linked to hormone disruption, fertility problems and a long list of health risks nobody asked for when they bought a bottle that smells nice.</p>\n          <p>TryScent is formulated <strong>without phthalates, parabens and synthetic chemicals linked to hormone disruption</strong>. You get the longevity without an ingredient list that looks like a safety data sheet.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">3</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/Designerperfym.png?v=1778094986\" alt=\"Regular designer perfume — the hidden cause of perfume headaches\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>If Regular Perfume Gives You Headaches, Here's Why</h3>\n          <p>Research shows that <strong>almost one in three people</strong> get headaches, breathing problems or skin reactions from regular perfumes. It's no coincidence and it's not a weakness. It's a direct reaction to the volatile organic compounds and synthetic chemicals that make up most commercial perfumes.</p>\n          <p>TryScent is <strong>built for sensitive skin and sensitive bodies</strong>. The formula is clean enough to wear every day, without the afternoon headache, the red patch on your neck or the sinus pressure that follows you into the room.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">4</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-17_at_10.59.01.jpg?v=1768713394\" alt=\"TryScent — vegan and cruelty-free perfume production\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>Cruelty-Free And Vegan: Smelling Good Shouldn't Come At An Animal's Expense</h3>\n          <p>No animal testing. No animal ingredients. TryScent is <strong>fully vegan and cruelty-free, certified and not just claimed</strong>. If you already make conscious choices about what you eat, wear and buy, this is the scent that fits the rest of the picture.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">5</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc7.png?v=1756129304\" alt=\"TryScent customer — clean perfume that lasts all day\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>Clean Doesn't Mean Weak. One Spray Still Lasts All Day.</h3>\n          <p>The biggest fear about switching to clean perfume is that it won't deliver. That it <strong>disappears by mid-morning</strong> and leaves nothing behind. It's a fair concern. Many clean perfumes do exactly that and sacrifice longevity to hit a certain price.</p>\n          <p>TryScent uses <strong>up to 21% perfume oil</strong>. That's what gives the longevity, not phthalates, not synthetic fixatives. Just a higher oil content that keeps the scent on your skin from morning to dinner.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">6</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc8.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"TryScent customer — risk-free 60-day trial\">\n          <div class=\"ts-badge-60\">